	(text "ESP32-S3 pin map\nIO0 BOOT (strap, low = download)   IO4 CAN_TX   IO5 CAN_RX   IO7 VBUS_SENSE (ADC1_CH6)\nIO8 TP_SDA   IO9 TP_SCL (I2C <= 400 kHz)   IO10 TP_INT   IO11 TP_RST\nIO13-16 status LEDs (active high, ~1.5 mA): HB heartbeat, SENSE scanning, COMM USB/CAN traffic, FAULT error\nUSB D-/D+ (IO19/IO20): native USB-Serial/JTAG + TinyUSB, flashing and debug over USB-C, no programmer needed.\nStrapping pins IO3, IO45, IO46 left unconnected. Keep Wi-Fi/BLE off while scanning: the radio is the largest noise source." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 172.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "735e1c2a-7c7b-4a38-b361-e23e5b86ef63"))
